## 1. Executive Summary

VERIFIED: This app’s market is not a daemon-driven exchange feed. It is a Laravel 12 request-driven OTC simulation. Prices and candles are generated on demand from deterministic timestamp math in [OtcPriceEngine.php](</mnt/w/refrence market/app/Services/OtcPriceEngine.php:192>). The browser fetches candles through `/trade/price-data`, then locally updates candles/ticks in [public/js/trade.js](</mnt/w/refrence market/public/js/trade.js:691>).

VERIFIED: Trade settlement is not strictly candle-close based. Settlement accepts a client-sent `close_price` from the frontend, unless pair/admin controls force an outcome, in [TradeController::settleTrade()`](</mnt/w/refrence market/app/Http/Controllers/TradeController.php:172>) and [TradeResultService::settle()`](</mnt/w/refrence market/app/Services/TradeResultService.php:24>).

No code was changed.

