## 4. Price Generation

VERIFIED:
- Base price comes from `base_price_override` first, then hardcoded symbol/type defaults: [OtcPriceEngine::getBasePrice()`](</mnt/w/refrence market/app/Services/OtcPriceEngine.php:46>).
- Live deterministic price is generated by wave/noise math using timestamp and symbol seed: [OtcPriceEngine::getDeterministicPrice()`](</mnt/w/refrence market/app/Services/OtcPriceEngine.php:192>).
- Pair `control_mode` affects price only for `pump` and `crash` by adding/subtracting `$volatility * 3.5`: [OtcPriceEngine.php](</mnt/w/refrence market/app/Services/OtcPriceEngine.php:241>).
- `simulatePrice()` returns deterministic current-time price: [OtcPriceEngine.php](</mnt/w/refrence market/app/Services/OtcPriceEngine.php:380>).

PRICE SOURCE -> PRICE CALCULATION -> DISTRIBUTION:
`Asset row/base defaults -> OtcPriceEngine::getDeterministicPrice(timestamp) -> generateCandles()/simulatePrice() -> TradeController::priceData()/settlement -> frontend`

## 5. Candle Generation

VERIFIED:
- Candles are generated directly from sampled deterministic prices, not persisted ticks: [OtcPriceEngine::generateCandles()`](</mnt/w/refrence market/app/Services/OtcPriceEngine.php:259>).
- Candle boundary: `floor($now / $tf) * $tf`: [OtcPriceEngine.php](</mnt/w/refrence market/app/Services/OtcPriceEngine.php:289>).
- Open is previous close, except first candle: [OtcPriceEngine.php](</mnt/w/refrence market/app/Services/OtcPriceEngine.php:301>).
- Close is deterministic price at candle end, or `time()` for current candle: [OtcPriceEngine.php](</mnt/w/refrence market/app/Services/OtcPriceEngine.php:308>).
- High/low sample four internal timestamps plus deterministic wick extension: [OtcPriceEngine.php](</mnt/w/refrence market/app/Services/OtcPriceEngine.php:315>).

No candle storage table/model was found.

