## 1. Price Engine Overview

VERIFIED: backend price generation is centralized in [OtcPriceEngine.php](<W:\refrence market\app\Services\OtcPriceEngine.php:19>). The core functions are `getBasePrice()` lines 46-135, `getSymbolSeed()` lines 140-149, `deterministicNoise()` lines 162-169, `smoothNoise()` lines 174-184, `getDeterministicPrice()` lines 192-251, and `generateCandles()` lines 259-353.

VERIFIED: the frontend duplicates most of this engine in [public/js/trade.js](<W:\refrence market\public\js\trade.js:573>) through `getSymbolSeed()`, `deterministicNoise()`, `smoothNoise()`, `getDeterministicPrice()`, `generateLocalData()`, and `pushPriceUpdate()`.

## 2. Exact Price Formula

VERIFIED: backend formula in `OtcPriceEngine::getDeterministicPrice()` is:

```text
base = getBasePrice(asset)
precision = getPrecision(base, asset)
pip = 10^-precision
volatility = base * 0.00030
seed = getSymbolSeed(asset.symbol)
t = timestamp

totalWave =
(
  sin(((t + ((seed*1337) % 157680000)) / 157680000) * 2pi) * 45
+ cos(((t + ((seed*773)  % 63072000 )) / 63072000 ) * 2pi) * 28
+ sin(((t + ((seed*521)  % 31536000 )) / 31536000 ) * 2pi) * 18
+ cos(((t + ((seed*317)  % 7776000  )) / 7776000  ) * 2pi) * 10
+ sin(((t + ((seed*199)  % 2592000  )) / 2592000  ) * 2pi) * 6
+ cos(((t + ((seed*97)   % 604800   )) / 604800   ) * 2pi) * 4
+ sin(((t + ((seed*43)   % 86400    )) / 86400    ) * 2pi) * 2.5
+ cos(((t + (seed % 14400)) / 14400) * 2pi) * 1.5
+ sin(((t + (seed % 3600 )) / 3600 ) * 2pi) * 0.9
+ sin((t + (seed % 997)) / 900) * 0.6
+ sin((t + (seed % 499)) / 240) * 0.4
+ cos((t + (seed % 251)) / 75) * 0.25
+ smoothNoise(seed+77,  t, 86400) * 4
+ smoothNoise(seed+33,  t, 3600 ) * 1.5
+ smoothNoise(seed,     t, 14   ) * 0.35
+ smoothNoise(seed+101, t, 4.5  ) * 0.15
) * volatility

adminDrift = pump ? volatility*3.5 : crash ? -volatility*3.5 : 0

price = round(max(pip, base + totalWave + adminDrift), precision)
```

Source: [OtcPriceEngine.php](<W:\refrence market\app\Services\OtcPriceEngine.php:192>).

## 3. Timestamp Dependency

VERIFIED: Unix timestamp is used directly as seconds in PHP. `simulatePrice()` passes `time()` at [OtcPriceEngine.php](<W:\refrence market\app\Services\OtcPriceEngine.php:380>). `generateCandles()` uses `time()` or request `endTime` at lines 263 and 309-312.

VERIFIED: frontend uses server-offset-adjusted browser time. `serverOffset = SERVER_TIMESTAMP*1000 - Date.now()` and `getNowSec()` floors to seconds: [trade.js](<W:\refrence market\public\js\trade.js:565>). Live ticks use floating seconds every 200ms: [trade.js](<W:\refrence market\public\js\trade.js:971>).

Smallest backend resolution is effectively one second when using `time()`, but `getDeterministicPrice()` accepts float timestamps. Frontend live movement uses sub-second timestamps.

## 4. Pair/Symbol Seed

VERIFIED: pair uniqueness comes from `Asset::symbol`, uppercased and trimmed, hashed by multiplying previous hash by 31 and adding each character code, masked to `0x7FFFFFFF`, then `% 1000000`: [OtcPriceEngine.php](<W:\refrence market\app\Services\OtcPriceEngine.php:140>).

Asset ID, code, and name are not used in the price seed. Symbol collisions are possible because the result is modulo 1,000,000, but collision likelihood was not runtime-tested.

## 5. Base Price Logic

VERIFIED priority:
1. `assets.base_price_override` if non-empty and > 0: [OtcPriceEngine.php](<W:\refrence market\app\Services\OtcPriceEngine.php:48>).
2. Hardcoded symbol matching against cleaned symbol and raw symbol: lines 56-127.
3. Fallback by `asset.type`: crypto 125, commodity 85, stock 150, index 5650: lines 129-132.
4. Final default `1.15488`: line 134.

`is_otc` and `is_active` do not alter the formula. If no DB asset exists, `TradeController::priceData()` creates a temporary in-memory `Asset` with symbol, auto mode, payout, and type: [TradeController.php](<W:\refrence market\app\Http\Controllers\TradeController.php:290>).

## 6. Volatility Logic

VERIFIED: volatility is always `basePrice * 0.00030`: [OtcPriceEngine.php](<W:\refrence market\app\Services\OtcPriceEngine.php:199>). It does not read `market_volume`, `trading_capital`, `max_pump_percent`, `max_crash_percent`, active trades, users, or timeframe.

## 7. Wave/Trend Logic

VERIFIED: the “trend” is a sum of deterministic long-period and short-period sine/cosine components. Periods include 5 years, 2 years, 1 year, 90 days, 30 days, 7 days, 1 day, 4 hours, 1 hour, 15 minutes, 4 minutes, and 75 seconds: [OtcPriceEngine.php](<W:\refrence market\app\Services\OtcPriceEngine.php:205>).

## 8. Noise/Randomness Logic

VERIFIED: backend market generation has deterministic pseudo-noise only. `deterministicNoise()` is arithmetic from seed and slot: [OtcPriceEngine.php](<W:\refrence market\app\Services\OtcPriceEngine.php:162>). `smoothNoise()` interpolates between deterministic slots using quintic smoothstep: [OtcPriceEngine.php](<W:\refrence market\app\Services\OtcPriceEngine.php:174>).

True randomness is not used in backend price/candle generation. True randomness does appear in settlement margin for forced outcomes via `mt_rand()` in `TradeResultService`, but that is settlement, not market generation.

## 9. Pump/Crash Logic

VERIFIED: admin writes pair mode through `AdminPairControlController::setMode()` to `assets.control_mode`, `control_expires_at`, and `win_side`: [AdminPairControlController.php](<W:\refrence market\app\Http\Controllers\Admin\AdminPairControlController.php:30>). Asset control also writes these fields plus `base_price_override`: [AdminAssetController.php](<W:\refrence market\app\Http\Controllers\Admin\AdminAssetController.php:98>).

VERIFIED: `pump` adds `base*0.00030*3.5`; `crash` subtracts the same. This affects any generated price and thus candles for all timeframes while active: [OtcPriceEngine.php](<W:\refrence market\app\Services\OtcPriceEngine.php:241>). Expiry auto-resets mode to auto inside price/candle calls: [OtcPriceEngine.php](<W:\refrence market\app\Services\OtcPriceEngine.php:389>).

Important divergence: frontend `getDeterministicPrice()` does not include pump/crash drift: [trade.js](<W:\refrence market\public\js\trade.js:610>).

## 10. Exact Candle Formula

VERIFIED: `generateCandles(asset, count, timeframeSec, endTime)`:
- `now = endTime ?: time()`
- `tf = max(5, timeframeSec)`
- `currentCandleStart = floor(now / tf) * tf`
- for each candle: `cTime = currentCandleStart - i*tf`

Source: [OtcPriceEngine.php](<W:\refrence market\app\Services\OtcPriceEngine.php:259>).

