VERIFIED: backend price is deterministic for the same `asset.symbol`, `base_price_override/type`, `digits`, `control_mode`, `control_expires_at` state, and timestamp. Future `Price(pair, T+N)` can be calculated from code without observing prior prices, unless configuration changes before `T+N`.

