## 8. Close Price Authority

Normal settlement path:
1. `settleTrade()` accepts request `close_price` if filled and > 0, rounded to 5 decimals: [TradeController.php](<W:\refrence market\app\Http\Controllers\TradeController.php:219>).
2. Passes it to `TradeResultService::settle()`: [TradeController.php](<W:\refrence market\app\Http\Controllers\TradeController.php:224>).
3. If forced side exists, service ignores client close price and creates a close price around open price: [TradeResultService.php](<W:\refrence market\app\Services\TradeResultService.php:65>).
