## 9. Complete Settlement Decision Tree

```text
TradeController::settleTrade()
 -> reject if trade user != Auth::id
 -> if result != pending, return stored result/close/payout
 -> if early_sell, set close_price/result/payout directly
 -> else clientClosePrice = request close_price if > 0 else null
 -> TradeResultService::settle(trade, clientClosePrice)

TradeResultService::settle()
 -> read asset, admin_override, open_price, precision
 -> derive forcedSide from pair control:
    force_win -> trade direction
    force_loss -> opposite direction
    pump -> up
    crash -> down
    else win_side -> determine side from pending trades
 -> admin_override then overwrites forcedSide
 -> if forcedSide exists:
    generate close_price open +/- mt_rand(4..16) pips
 -> else:
    close_price = clientClosePrice or simulated current price
    if equal to open, nudge +/- 1 pip
 -> compare close vs open by direction
 -> payout = trade.payout for win, investment for tie, 0 for loss
 -> update trade close_price/result/closed_at/spike_injected
 -> credit user balance if payout > 0
 -> process referral commission
```

Sources: [TradeController.php:172](<W:\refrence market\app\Http\Controllers\TradeController.php:172>), [TradeResultService.php:24](<W:\refrence market\app\Services\TradeResultService.php:24>).

