## 26. Failure Paths

VERIFIED risks:
- If user save succeeds but trade insert fails, balance may be deducted without a trade because no transaction wraps both.
- If trade update succeeds but user balance credit fails, trade may be closed without credit.
- Invalid/missing `open_price` falls back to backend simulation only if absent or <=0.
- Invalid/missing `close_price` falls back to backend simulation only in normal settlement.
- Deleted asset can break settlement because `TradeResultService` assumes `$trade->asset` exists.
- Browser disappears: trade remains pending until later request-driven settlement.
- Duplicate settlement has no lock protection.

