| Manual rollback | Admin restores previous config | Follows restored policy | Follows restored policy | PRODUCT DECISION REQUIRED | PRODUCT DECISION REQUIRED | Refresh/sync required | New audit event |
| Automatic expiration | Effective inactive after expiry | Neutral after expiry | Neutral after expiry | Depends snapshot/live model | Depends model | Needs status refresh | Optional unless persisted |
| Failed deployment | Disable new global feature path | Existing behavior | Existing behavior | Existing behavior unless stored state consumed | Existing behavior | Existing UI | Audit deployment/admin action |
| Bad config | Restore previous valid config | Re-evaluate | Re-evaluate | PRODUCT DECISION REQUIRED | PRODUCT DECISION REQUIRED | Refresh | Audit |
| Emergency disable | Disable global control itself | Existing/pair behavior | Existing/pair behavior | PRODUCT DECISION REQUIRED | PRODUCT DECISION REQUIRED | Status update | Audit |

